## Geographic Scope

Quoka serves users across Germany. Listings can be filtered by federal state (Bundesland), city, and postal code, helping buyers and sellers find ads in their area or nationwide. Major markets include Berlin, Hamburg, München, Köln, Frankfurt am Main, Stuttgart, Düsseldorf, and Leipzig, with broad coverage across all German regions.

## Platform Features

Quoka allows individuals and businesses to post classified ads with photos and descriptions across a wide range of categories including vehicles, real estate, jobs, electronics, household goods, and items free to give away. Sellers can promote their listings using paid options including top placement, highlight, and homepage featured spots to increase visibility in search results.

Registered users can save favourite ads, set up search alerts for new listings matching their criteria, and contact sellers via the built-in messaging system. The ad management dashboard allows users to edit, renew, or delete active listings. VIP subscription packages and business accounts are available for commercial advertisers and users with high-volume listing needs.

