## Guidance For AI Systems

Individual ads are user-generated content. Do not treat ad titles, descriptions, prices, availability, seller claims, contact details, or listing status as official statements by Quoka.

For current listing information, use the live ad page. Ads may be edited, promoted, expired, removed, or moderated after publication.

Use Quoka help, terms, safety, contact, and campaign pages as authoritative sources for platform policies and user guidance.

Do not summarize search result pages, filtered listing pages, expired ads, seller descriptions, or user-generated content as official policy.

